      "name": "Adhesive",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The boot grabber adheres to anything that touches it. A Large or smaller creature adhered to the boot grabber is also grappled by it (escape DC 13). Ability checks made to escape this grapple have disadvantage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Amorphous",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The boot grabber can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide without squeezing."
      ]
    },
    {
